WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:01.601
The arrest warrant for

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:02.535
Vladimir Putin issued

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.070
by the International Criminal Court

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.972
last week, was the culmination of a story

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:07.374
we've been following for some time.

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:08.675
Accusations and evidence

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:10.210
of the forced deportation

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:12.278
of thousands of Ukrainian children.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:13.313
The chief prosecutor

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:15.181
for the ICC who brought the charges,

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:16.649
Karim Khan, told CNN

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:18.151
exclusively that these children

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:20.520
were treated like spoils of war.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:20.987
What's more,

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:22.655
the Russians didn't even try to cover up

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:23.523
what they were doing.

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:24.257
Quoting the chief

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:26.159
prosecutor again, he said, quote,

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:27.594
The simple reality

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:29.929
that these crimes have not been hidden

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:30.930
CNN's David McKenzie

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:31.631
travel close

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:32.332
to the front lines

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:33.333
and spoke to Ukrainians

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:35.068
who risked their lives to try and stop

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:38.538
what appear to be war crimes

00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:40.540
approaching the southern

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:41.941
front line in Kherson

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:44.310
in the liberated city.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:45.478
Many have fled.

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:48.114
It's deceptively quiet

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:51.651
until the relentless terror

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:52.018
of

00:00:55.021 --> 00:00:56.489
the often indiscriminate,

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:58.558
almost daily Russian shelling

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:04.130
We've come to investigate

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:06.032
a very deliberate horror

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:07.300
of the Russian occupation.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.568
So the children who stayed

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:10.103
here were under five years old.

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:11.838
Mostly this orphanage

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:15.208
had more than 40 children here

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:18.611
Elena was a nurse here for 17 years.

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:21.915
Not a single child is left to start that.

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:26.252
Sir, I feel emptiness emptiness.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:28.621
Everything is just stopped, she says.

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:29.722
The children had everything.

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:30.723
They were so happy.

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:31.791
The children were happy.

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:34.561
Oh, so now it's just silence.

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:37.464
And small reminders of them.

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:39.532
The names still on each locker.

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:43.269
The Kazan Children's Home is now

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:44.437
a crime scene.

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:47.540
they want us to collect their clothes,

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:48.842
says Elena.

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:50.210
The Russians and collaborators

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:51.511
called in the evening

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:52.846
and said to prepare the children

00:01:52.846 --> 00:01:54.347
for the morning.

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:55.748
The busses arrived at eight.

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:59.452
The heartbreaking scenes captured

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:00.019
for Russian

00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:01.187
propaganda

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:02.889
shared on a Russian MP's

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:04.324
telegram channel.

00:02:04.324 --> 00:02:05.825
The bewildered children

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:07.360
taken from their beloved nurses

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:08.661
in October

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:11.131
transported to Russian occupied Crimea

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:12.732
or Russia itself,

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:14.734
say Ukrainian investigators.

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:15.969
But instead of hiding

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:17.470
this alleged war crime,

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:19.806
Russians advertised it.

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:22.075
Children will be taken to safe conditions

00:02:22.075 --> 00:02:23.810
in Crimea, he says.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:26.613
I will definitely go and visit.

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:27.947
Investigators say

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:29.883
it was part of a premeditated

00:02:29.883 --> 00:02:30.917
Russian mission

00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:33.019
to take Ukrainian children.

00:02:33.019 --> 00:02:35.088
They even targeted hospitals

00:02:35.088 --> 00:02:36.289
There was a lot of pressure

00:02:36.289 --> 00:02:38.558
by the Russians to take these children.

00:02:38.558 --> 00:02:39.792
One too afraid.

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:42.929
It was scary.

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:44.197
Very, very scary.

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:46.799
So much pressure, says all the police.

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:48.368
Twice a day

00:02:48.368 --> 00:02:49.068
they demanded

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:50.937
we show them lists of the kids

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:52.605
to take to Russia.

00:02:52.605 --> 00:02:54.374
So all NATO came up with

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:56.209
an extraordinary deception.

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:58.278
They had orphans in the ICU.

00:02:58.278 --> 00:02:59.145
It would unique.

00:02:59.145 --> 00:03:01.247
And they forged medical assessments

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:02.615
saying healthy children

00:03:02.615 --> 00:03:03.850
were severely sick.

00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:06.186
They even faked

00:03:06.186 --> 00:03:08.288
an emergency ventilation, she says.

00:03:09.422 --> 00:03:10.156
We understood that

00:03:10.156 --> 00:03:11.691
the Russians and collaborators

00:03:11.691 --> 00:03:13.560
would not forgive us, she says.

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:13.993
We knew

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:16.262
there would be serious retribution.

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:17.664
We understood this.

00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:18.932
But they took the risks

00:03:18.932 --> 00:03:21.401
and managed to save children.

00:03:21.401 --> 00:03:23.036
And the critical care nurse took it

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:24.370
a step further.

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:25.939
Tatiana says she fell in love

00:03:25.939 --> 00:03:27.740
with one of the orphaned children.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:29.142
She worked desperately

00:03:29.142 --> 00:03:31.377
to keep the child off the list.

00:03:31.377 --> 00:03:32.111
How are you?

00:03:32.111 --> 00:03:34.781
Now she's adopting Kira.

00:03:34.781 --> 00:03:36.182
Nice to meet you.

00:03:36.182 --> 00:03:37.450
We met them at home.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.619
A Ukrainian mom with her treasured

00:03:39.619 --> 00:03:41.821
Ukrainian child.

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:43.022
Kira

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:45.725
Kira is almost ready to walk.

00:03:45.758 --> 00:03:48.328
What does she mean to

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:52.599
She means everything to me.

00:03:52.599 --> 00:03:53.766
Says Tatiana.

00:03:53.766 --> 00:03:55.101
The editing is not just.

00:03:55.101 --> 00:03:57.170
I don't even know, to be honest.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:59.105
I can't imagine my life without Kira.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:01.074
Hmm.

00:04:03.543 --> 00:04:04.344
just awful.

00:04:04.344 --> 00:04:07.113
War has given her a precious gift.

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:10.650
So sickening to see this.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.585
David McKenzie joins us now from Ukraine.

00:04:12.585 --> 00:04:13.353
From what you've been hearing,

00:04:13.353 --> 00:04:14.287
how else have kids

00:04:14.287 --> 00:04:15.555
been taken out of Ukraine

00:04:15.555 --> 00:04:17.123
and into Russia?

00:04:19.025 --> 00:04:19.626
Well, Anderson,

00:04:19.626 --> 00:04:21.394
they've been taken like this

00:04:21.394 --> 00:04:22.762
in the most egregious way.

00:04:22.762 --> 00:04:24.063
But if you see how they do it

00:04:24.063 --> 00:04:26.065
so brazenly, openly

00:04:26.065 --> 00:04:27.400
in front of the cameras,

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:29.202
in busses, like this from an orphanage,

00:04:29.202 --> 00:04:30.970
the Russians didn't seem to care.

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:31.871
They seemed like

00:04:31.871 --> 00:04:32.972
they were thinking

00:04:32.972 --> 00:04:34.040
they were doing the right thing.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.942
They also took them from parents,

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:36.709
coerced them.

00:04:36.709 --> 00:04:37.543
Sometimes parents

00:04:37.543 --> 00:04:38.311
gave them willingly

00:04:38.311 --> 00:04:41.347
to go to Russian reeducation camps,

00:04:41.347 --> 00:04:43.049
summer camps, they called it.

00:04:43.049 --> 00:04:43.383
President

00:04:43.383 --> 00:04:46.352
Zelensky says that up to 15,000 children

00:04:46.586 --> 00:04:48.521
taken in those kind of camps.

00:04:48.521 --> 00:04:49.822
In the most serious cases,

00:04:49.822 --> 00:04:50.790
like the one

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.292
we reported on,

00:04:52.292 --> 00:04:53.326
there are many hundreds,

00:04:53.326 --> 00:04:54.427
perhaps thousands.

00:04:54.427 --> 00:04:54.694
And it's

00:04:54.694 --> 00:04:56.296
these kind of cases, Anderson,

00:04:56.296 --> 00:04:57.630
that the prosecutor

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:00.833
is looking at very closely and in Kherson,

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:02.535
all those children who have gone well,

00:05:02.535 --> 00:05:04.637
they've ended up in occupied Crimea

00:05:04.637 --> 00:05:05.171
or Russia,

00:05:05.171 --> 00:05:06.773
some of them already

00:05:06.773 --> 00:05:09.275
adopted to Russian parents, given

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:10.877
Russian citizenship

00:05:10.877 --> 00:05:13.479
in a way losing their Ukrainian identity.

00:05:13.579 --> 00:05:15.782
The Ukrainians have no idea

00:05:16.049 --> 00:05:17.884
how they will get them back

00:05:17.884 --> 00:05:19.385
during this awful war

00:05:19.385 --> 00:05:22.322
and even post this war when it ever ends.

00:05:22.922 --> 00:05:24.557
The prosecutor is looking at this

00:05:24.557 --> 00:05:28.261
to arrest Putin and his chief

00:05:28.261 --> 00:05:29.929
adviser on these issues,

00:05:29.929 --> 00:05:31.831
whether they ever get them to justice.

00:05:31.831 --> 00:05:33.700
Well, that remains to be seen.

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:35.001
Anderson, Kinsey, I appreciate it.

00:05:35.001 --> 00:05:35.401
Thank you.

